{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國男星基斯洛克（Chris Rock）於「奧斯卡金像獎」因衰多口被影星好友韋史密夫（Will Smith）當眾上台掌摑，最終韋接受大懲罰禁止出席「奧斯卡」10年，而基斯亦在事件後一直未有出席過「奧斯卡」。</p><p>事隔4年，基斯近日受訪時「開綠燈」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T16:21:01.012379+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T16:01:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T16:14:12.750253+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T16:14:12.750253+00:00","content_hash":"7c2abdc4e5df97a1ca985eca130a6096363a2ea2f052c237e54103f9b2eea441","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}